{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EoAhZmaN67F5kWud33pdPp","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# exec-sim-repair-verifier — Research Dashboard\n2\t\n3\t> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 02:35 UTC | 更新原因: 填入 CLS 4B mutation 数据 + 标记 P/R 关键发现 + cuda:0 shard3 加速计划\n4\t\n5\t## 核心方向\n6\tTask reformulation: execution simulation from generation → classification。核心假设：CLS 优势随代码复杂度增长。详见 paper_framing.md。\n7\t\n8\t## 当前进展\n9\t- **阶段**: Paper Writing（Paper Agent Full Draft）+ CWM 8B eval 收尾 + mutation breakdown 全面对比\n10\t- **DDL**: EMNLP 2026 ARR May 25（剩余 **9 天**）\n11\t- **C1**: ✅ Multi-seed gap = 26.48pp mean (s42: 26.44, seed123: 26.51)\n12\t- **C2**: ✅ TOST p=0.007\n13\t- **C3**: ✅ Oracle frontier 完成\n14\t- **新发现**: CWM 8B unparseable=73.8%（4B→8B scaling 使 CWM 更差）→ generation formulation bottleneck 铁证\n15\t- **新发现**: off_by_one 是 4B→8B 最大赢家 (+28pp)，boundary_removal 是 scale-invariant 难题 (±0pp)\n16\t\n17\t## 论文主表数字（D088 val-selected）\n18\t\n19\t| 模型 | Val-best | Val | Test | vs CWM gap |\n20\t|------|----------|-----|------|------------|\n21\t| CLS 8B s42 | ckpt-3600 | 90.28% | 84.48% | 26.44pp |\n22\t| CLS 8B seed123 | ckpt-3000 | 88.69% | 85.60% | 26.51pp |\n23\t| CLS 4B s42 | ckpt-4600 | 90.07% | 83.63% | 25.59pp |\n24\t| CWM 4B s42 | — | — | 58.04% | — |\n25\t| CWM 4B seed123 | — | — | 59.09% | — |\n26\t| CWM 8B | ckpt-400 | — | ⏳ eval 3-shard 并行 | — |\n27\t| Majority | — | 75.88% | 72.96% | — |\n28\t\n29\t## Mutation Breakdown 对比（收集中）\n30\t\n31\t| Mutation | CLS 4B | CLS 8B s42 | CLS 8B s123 | CWM 4B | CWM 8B |\n32\t|----------|--------|------------|-------------|--------|--------|\n33\t| gold | 98.25% | 96.24% | 99.6% | ⏳ | ⏳ |\n34\t| off_by_one | **58.47%** | **86.89%** | **79.2%** | ⏳ | ⏳ |\n35\t| operator_swap | 78.91% | 81.38% | 82.6% | ⏳ | ⏳ |\n36\t| return_value | 67.97% | 75.44% | 66.4% | ⏳ | ⏳ |\n37\t| boundary_removal | 46.90% | 46.90% | 44.9% | ⏳ | ⏳ |\n38\t\n39\t**关键 P/R 发现** (CLS 4B):\n40\t- off_by_one recall_fail=0% → 4B 完全盲区，8B 修复 (+28pp)\n41\t- boundary_removal recall_fail=15.52% → 极端 pass bias，scale-invariant\n42\t- 8B P/R 分析已派 Agent（CPU 任务），完成后可做完整 4B vs 8B failure mode 对比\n43\t\n44\t## 近期任务\n45\t- [ ] CWM 8B eval 3-shard 并行完成 → 锁 8B-8B gap\n46\t- [ ] CWM 4B per-mutation breakdown (cuda:2 worker 进行中)\n47\t- [ ] CLS 8B ckpt-3600 per-test P/R（CPU 分析，已派）\n48\t- [ ] Shard merge: v3 + shard2 + shard3 去重\n49\t- [ ] CWM 8B mutation breakdown（eval 完成后）\n50\t- [ ] 汇总完整 mutation comparison → Paper Agent\n51\t- [ ] Paper Writing: 整合 scaling + mutation 发现\n52\t\n53\t## GPU 状态\n54\t| GPU | 任务 | 状态 |\n55\t|-----|------|------|\n56\t| westd cuda:0 | CWM 8B eval shard3 (gap shard) | 待启动 |\n57\t| westd cuda:1 | cwm8b-ckpt400-test-eval-shard2 (idx 7680-9784) | RUNNING (待确认) |\n58\t| westd cuda:2 | CWM 4B mutation breakdown | Worker 进行中 |\n59\t| westd cuda:3 | cwm8b-ckpt400-test-eval-v3 (~57%) | RUNNING |\n60\t\n61\t## 关键约束\n62\t- D088: val-selected checkpoint 为主指标\n63\t- Val baseline = 75.88%, Test baseline = 72.96%\n64\t- CWM 8B eval 是最后一个阻塞主表的实验\n65\t\n66\t## 关键决策日志\n67\t\n68\t| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\n69\t|----|------|------|----------|\n70\t| D109 | 2026-05-16 | CWM 8B 合并完成 (65.17% acc, 73.8% unparseable)；论文叙事调整 | cwm8b-ckpt400-test-eval-v3, cwm8b-ckpt400-test-eval-shard2 |\n71\t| D108 | 2026-05-16 | Scope 扩展：加第二模型家族 + re-repair downstream 实验，回应 gene | — |\n72\t| D107 | 2026-05-16 | Oracle ICC 不一致：选择方案 B，增加 repo-level ICC=0.3146 的 s | block-corr-empirical, oracle-f2p-stratified |\n73\t| D106 | 2026-05-16 | CLS 8B per-problem 分析：matplotlib-24177（16% 数据量，100 | model-size-scaling-cls8b, block-corr-empirical |\n74\t| D105 | 2026-05-16 | Reviewer 跨模型 mutation 分析：论文需报告 off_by_one scaling  | cwm4b-s42-mutation-breakdown, cls4b-ckpt4600-test-mutation-pr, cls8b-seed123-ckpt3000-mutation, model-size-scaling-cls8b |\n75\t| D104 | 2026-05-16 | CWM 4B mutation breakdown 确认 Generation Bottleneck | cwm4b-s42-mutation-breakdown, cls4b-ckpt4600-test-mutation-pr, cls8b-seed123-ckpt3000-mutation |\n76\t| D103 | 2026-05-15 | seq4096 降级为未授权 worker 决策，seq8192 sweep 必须以 seq8192 | cls8b-s42-resume-val-sweep-seq8192, cls8b-s42-resume-val-sweep-seq4096, cls8b-s42-resume-val-sweep-seq8192-v2 |\n77\t| D102 | 2026-05-15 | 批准 CWM 8B eval 从 bs=1 改 bs=8 重启，ETA 从 May 18 提前到 M | cwm8b-ckpt400-test-eval |\n78\t| D101 | 2026-05-15 | CWM Relaxed Matching 分析：unparseable 预测默认到 majority | cwm-relaxed-matching |\n79\t| D100 | 2026-05-15 | CWM relaxed matching 反而降低准确率，彻底排除 \"parsing failure | cwm-relaxed-matching |\n80\t\n81\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01RteQYoZMLFdQHT5qq4xJgz","session_id":"23fb2834-2812-4457-b569-54861da1d013","uuid":"56a07080-7710-4bcc-8011-5e0ebc9eda35","timestamp":"2026-05-16T08:02:46.370Z"}
