ull/swebench_train.jsonl):\n   - Full patched code + test file → pass/fail\n   - Source: SWE-bench Verified (500 instances + candidates)\n   - Used **only when** function-level files unavailable (precedence: repo > function)\n\n### **Experimental Context**\n\nThese DeepSeek experiments are part of a **task reformulation study** (per project ROADMAP):\n- **Core claim**: Binary classification (pass/fail prediction) is superior to generation-based execution simulation (CWM) for code repair verification\n- **Comparison**: DeepSeek-6.7B classification vs. generation against Qwen3-4B/8B baselines\n- **Scope**: Validates whether the task reformulation insight (classification vs. generation) generalizes across model families (Qwen → DeepSeek)\n\n### **Key Findings from Registry**\n\nThe only completed experiment (deepseek-cwm-func) shows:\n- **Successful convergence** with low final loss (0.0986 train, 0.04292 eval)\n- **Fast training** (~87 min on single A100)\n- **Reproducible setup** confirmed via LoRA + deterministic training\n\nThe other three experiments (cls-repo, cls-func, cwm-func-s123) are still running/analyzing as of 2026-05-16 08:00 UTC.\n\n---\n\n**File Paths for Reference**:\n- Training script: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/train_unified.py`\n- Registry entries: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/registry.yaml` (lines 6387–6500)\n- Completed checkpoint: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/checkpoints/deepseek-cwm-func_DONE_20260516T080116.json`\n- Dream reports: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/artifacts/dream_reports/`\n- Project context: `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/ROADMAP.md` and `/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_16/projects/exec-sim-repair-verifier/memory.md`"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":nul