{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Jw6sD8kESkXq5w3icXgCpy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have comprehensive context. Let me build the worst-tier imagined experiments YAML. \n\nKey things I learned:\n1. DeepSeek experiments use DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct with LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32)\n2. There are 4 DeepSeek experiments: cls-func, cwm-func, cwm-func-s123, cls-repo\n3. Error complementarity: CLS FN 75.5%, CWM FP 83.1%, oracle 90.63%\n4. Inference cost: CLS 1-token vs CWM ~6.2 tokens mean, 3.1x token overhead but only 1.09x latency on CPU\n\n\n5. At repo-level, CLS dominates with 83.63% accuracy versus CWM's 58.04%, though CWM's failure was due to parsing issues\n\nFor the worst-tier assumptions, I'm working with repo-level CLS accuracy in the [75, 80] range—lower than the actual 82.35-83.63% single-seed results, suggesting other seeds performed worse and dragged the multi-seed mean down. The fail_f1 metric of [50, 62] aligns with the observed 60.87% from the checkpoint, so that's a reasonable bound.\n\nThe 8B CLS-to-CWM gap of 2.43 percentage points sits right at the top of the worst-tier range [1.0, 2.5], and the practical per-test advantage hovers around 25-35%. Under this scenario, the narrative shifts away from claiming classification superiority toward framing these as complementary approaches with distinct failure patterns, positioning the work as an empirical characterization paper for EMNLP's analysis track with Findings as a fallback. The diagnostic re-repair experiment likely doesn't run in worst-tier conditions, and if it does, shows minimal gains, while the swebench per-test data collection remains part of the planned work.\n\nFor the DeepSeek validation runs, I'm concerned about several failure modes: the CLS-to-CWM gap could shrink or even reverse on DeepSeek compared to Qwen, CWM might outperform CLS relative to what we saw before, the multi-seed runs could reveal high variance, and repo-level performance might diverge significantly with different failure patterns. I need to think through what this means for the YAML construction and whether these worst-case scenarios actually undermine the core claims or just require reframing around robustness and model-specific behavior.\n\nLooking back at the user's request, they're asking about experiments with \"planned\" status in the experiment_plan, but the DeepSeek runs are in the registry with RUNNING status. The worst-tier definition explicitly mentions DeepSeek failures though, so I should include all experiments without final results—both the planned ones like diagnostic-rerepair and swebench-pertest-data, plus the active DeepSeek validation runs.\n\nNow I'm working through each experiment to construct the comprehensive YAML, starting with diagnostic-rerepair and its worst-case assumption that without downstream re-repair experiments, the per-test diagnostic value remains purely theoretical.\n\nFor diagnostic-rerepair, I'm predicting it runs but shows negligible improvement—baseline resolve rate stays around 28-30%, maybe bumping to 28.5-30.5% with diagnostics, since T=1 dominance at 68.7% and prediction noise around 83% precision means the repair agent can't effectively leverage noisy diagnostic information.\n\nFor swebench-pertest-data, this is about dataset construction rather than model performance, so the worst-tier assumption affects distribution characteristics more than success—I expect the dataset constructs successfully but confirms T=1 dominance, making discrimination harder.\n\nFor deepseek-cls-func, the worst case is that DeepSeek shows a different pattern from Qwen, with lower CLS accuracy.\n\nDeepSeek-CLS should land around 87-89% accuracy similar to Qwen's range, but the gap between CLS and CWM might shrink or even reverse since DeepSeek-Coder is specialized for code generation, meaning CWM benefits more from the base model's stronger generation capabilities.\n\nFor deepseek-cwm-func with one seed already evaluated at 0.04292 loss, the worst case is CWM performing better relative to CLS on DeepSeek, potentially reaching 87.5% or higher accuracy.\n\nThe multi-seed runs and repo-level experiments will either show high variance between seeds or reveal whether DeepSeek's performance degrades significantly at the repository level, which could complicate the narrative around architecture-independence.\n\nNow I need to write out the full YAML with specific metrics and rationales, and I should also check what other planned experiments exist beyond these running ones. I also need to account for the repo-level multi-seed validation that the worst-tier metric depends on, and make sure the CWM repo-level experiment uses the correct max_new_tokens setting based on reviewer feedback.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1939,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5570,"cache_read_input_tokens":62088,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5570},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"23fb2834-2812-4457-b569-54861da1d013","uuid":"fadf3b6f-3c7b-4631-8334-8f481ecbfba4"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Jw6sD8kESkXq5w3icXgCpy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have all the context needed. Let me construct the comprehensive worst-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Pivot到三个互补angle: (1) Efficiency equivalence——CLS用1-token output达到CWM N-token\n  相同accuracy，inference cost降低3-10x (GPU场景更显著); (2) Oracle characterization——\n  empirically grounded decision framework for when per-test helps (T≥2, regression \n  rate≥10%, block-correlated errors); (3) Error complementarity——CLS/CWM failure modes\n  系统性互补（CLS漏报75.5%, CWM误报83.1%），oracle ensemble 90.63%，suggesting formulation \n  diversity as verification strategy。不再claim 'classification is better'，改为\n  'classification and generation are complementary formulations with predictable failure \n  modes'。仍冲EMNLP main作为empirical characterization paper（类似analysis track），\n  fallback Findings。Repo-level evidence不足：multi-seed mean accuracy 77-79%，seed间\n  variance 4-6pp，reviewer会要求额外seed或质疑prompt设计。DeepSeek实验显示不同pattern，\n  削弱architecture-independence claim——改为honest reporting \"gap is architecture-dependent, \n  further investigation needed\"。Per-test diagnostic value降级为theoretical argument \n  with oracle ceiling analysis（无re-repair实证）。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Diagnostic Re-repair Experiment\"\n    plan_id: \"diagnostic-rerepair\"\n    description: >\n      给修复代理提供per-test failure predictions vs 无per-test信息，\n      在200个instances上比较resolve rate。使用SWE-agent框架，\n      classification模型提供per-test诊断。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_resolve_rate_pct: 29.0\n      with_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pct: 29.5\n      resolve_rate_gain_pp: 0.5\n      gain_significant_at_005: false\n      mcnemar_p_value: 0.72\n      instances_helped_by_diagnostic: 5\n      instances_hurt_by_diagnostic: 4\n      net_helped: 1\n      diagnostic_precision_on_helped: 0.80\n      diagnostic_precision_on_hurt: 0.60\n      oracle_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pct: 33.5\n      oracle_vs_baseline_gain_pp: 4.5\n      oracle_vs_predicted_gap_pp: 4.0\n      time_cost_per_instance_baseline_min: 8.2\n      time_cost_per_instance_diagnostic_min: 8.5\n      T1_instances_in_200: 137\n      T1_gain_pp: 0.0\n      T2plus_instances_in_200: 63\n      T2plus_gain_pp: 1.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst档假设\"无downstream re-repair实验，per-test diagnostic value仅为theoretical \n      argument\"。即使勉强跑完实验，gain仅+0.5pp（29.5% vs 29.0%），原因：\n      (1) 200个instances中~137个(68.7%)是T=1，per-test信息与trajectory-level数学等价，\n      诊断信号零增益；\n      (2) 剩余63个T≥2 instances中，per-test prediction precision ~80%意味着每5个predicted-fail\n      中约1个是误报——修复代理基于错误诊断做了无效修复尝试（4个instances被误导）；\n      (3) 仅5个instances中诊断真正帮助定位了具体失败测试并引导修复成功——但这些大多是\n      T=2且两个测试failure mode清晰分离的\"easy\"案例；\n      (4) Oracle上界（33.5%）显示per-test信息在完美条件下有价值（+4.5pp），但predicted \n      diagnostic仅能实现11%的oracle ceiling（0.5/4.5）；\n      (5) McNemar p=0.72，远不显著——200个instances的power不足以检测<1pp的差异。\n      这个结果在worst档叙事中将Claim 2完全降级为theoretical argument。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Diagnostic re-repair: predicted vs oracle per-test information\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Resolve Rate (%)\", \"Δ vs Baseline (pp)\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No diagnostic (baseline)\", 29.0, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Predicted per-test diagnostic\", 29.5, \"+0.5\", \"0.72\"]\n          - [\"Oracle per-test (ceiling)\", 33.5, \"+4.5\", \"0.02\"]\n      - caption: \"Re-repair gain stratified by F2P test count\"\n        columns: [\"T bucket\", \"N instances\", \"Baseline resolve %\", \"Diagnostic resolve %\", \"Δ pp\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"T=1\", 137, 30.7, 30.7, \"0.0\"]\n          - [\"T=2\", 40, 25.0, 27.5, \"+2.5\"]\n          - [\"T≥3\", 23, 21.7, 21.7, \"0.0\"]\n          - [\"All\", 200, 29.0, 29.5, \"+0.5\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: three conditions (baseline, predicted, oracle) showing oracle ceiling vs achievable gain, with error bars from bootstrap\"\n      - \"Scatter plot: per-instance diagnostic precision vs re-repair success, showing no correlation (r=0.04)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Oracle ceiling（+4.5pp）与predicted gain（+0.5pp）之间的巨大gap（4.0pp）\n      证实了worst档的核心论断：per-test诊断的价值是真实的但目前prediction quality\n      不足以释放这个价值。在pivot论文中，这成为\"future work\"的明确方向——\n      提升per-test prediction precision到>90%可能释放更多oracle ceiling。\n      但当前实验结论是negative：predicted diagnostics do not significantly \n      improve repair outcomes。\n\n  - name: \"SWE-bench Per-Test Dataset Construction\"\n    plan_id: \"swebench-pertest-data\"\n    description: >\n      Docker重新评估SWE-bench Verified patches，提取per-test labels。\n      构建SWE-bench-PerTest数据集（500 instances × 16 candidates）。\n    expected_results:\n      total_instances_attempted: 500\n      successful_evaluations: 458\n      failed_docker_builds: 27\n      timeout_evaluations: 15\n      total_candidate_test_pairs: 115872\n      avg_tests_per_instance: 15.8\n      avg_f2p_tests_per_instance: 2.1\n      median_f2p_tests: 1\n      pct_T1_instances: 71.2\n      pct_T2_instances: 16.8\n      pct_T3plus_instances: 12.0\n      avg_p2p_tests_per_instance: 13.7\n      pass_rate_overall: 0.73\n      fail_rate_overall: 0.27\n      p2p_regression_rate: 0.8\n      construction_time_hours: 24\n      gold_patch_all_pass_rate: 0.96\n      candidate_diversity_unique_test_signatures: 312\n    result_rationale: >\n      数据集构建是工程任务，worst档不影响技术成功率。但分布特征在worst档下\n      对论文叙事不利：\n      (1) T=1占71.2%（高于function-level oracle sim的68.7%），意味着repo-level\n      数据中per-test粒度的理论优势更稀薄——超过7成instances只有1个F2P测试；\n      (2) median F2P=1确认了T=1 mode的dominance；\n      (3) P2P regression rate仅0.8%（远低于oracle sim中reg≥10%的threshold），\n      意味着PASS_TO_PASS测试几乎不提供额外信号——patch极少破坏已通过的测试；\n      (4) overall pass rate 73%意味着class imbalance加剧（vs function-level ~50:50），\n      majority baseline就有73%，fine-tuned模型需要beat这个high baseline；\n      (5) 42/500 instances因Docker build failure或timeout丢失（8.4%），\n      可能引入selection bias——失败的往往是环境最复杂的instances，恰恰是\n      per-test可能最有价值的instances。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"SWE-bench-PerTest dataset statistics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Instances (successful)\", 458]\n          - [\"Candidates per instance (mean)\", 16]\n          - [\"Total (code, test) pairs\", \"115,872\"]\n          - [\"F2P tests per instance (mean / median)\", \"2.1 / 1\"]\n          - [\"P2P tests per instance (mean)\", 13.7]\n          - [\"T=1 instances\", \"71.2%\"]\n          - [\"T≥2 instances\", \"28.8%\"]\n          - [\"Overall pass rate\", \"73%\"]\n          - [\"P2P regression rate\", \"0.8%\"]\n      - caption: \"F2P test count distribution\"\n        columns: [\"T\", \"% Instances\", \"Cumulative %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [1, 71.2, 71.2]\n          - [2, 16.8, 88.0]\n          - [3, 5.2, 93.2]\n          - [\"4-5\", 3.8, 97.0]\n          - [\"6+\", 3.0, 100.0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Histogram: F2P test count distribution showing strong T=1 mode with long tail\"\n      - \"Box plot: per-instance test count (F2P vs P2P) showing P2P >> F2P\"\n    analysis: >\n      数据集本身作为resource contribution有独立价值。但worst档下的分布特征\n      系统性地削弱per-test方法的pitch：T=1主导+低regression rate意味着\n      大多数instances中per-test粒度退化为trajectory-level等价。\n      73%的pass rate使得\"预测fail\"成为稀有事件检测问题，precision-recall\n      tradeoff更不利。论文需诚实报告这些分布特征并作为characterization贡献。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek-Coder CLS Function-Level\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-cls-func\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32) 在function-level\n      数据上训练classification (pass/fail)。验证CLS formulation是否\n      architecture-independent。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_accuracy: 88.73\n      pass_f1: 88.85\n      fail_f1: 88.60\n      pass_precision: 90.50\n      pass_recall: 87.25\n      fail_precision: 87.00\n      fail_recall: 90.30\n      train_loss: 0.210\n      eval_loss: 0.075\n      train_runtime_sec: 4800\n      unparseable: 0\n      cls_vs_cwm_gap_deepseek_pp: 0.52\n      cls_vs_cwm_gap_qwen4b_pp: 1.25\n      cls_vs_cwm_gap_qwen8b_pp: 2.43\n      gap_trend_with_size: \"non-monotonic\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst档核心假设：\"DeepSeek实验显示不同pattern，削弱architecture-independence claim\"。\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B是code-specialized模型（vs Qwen3通用模型），其预训练数据\n      包含大量代码执行trace，这使得CWM (generation)任务对DeepSeek相对更容易：\n      (1) DeepSeek-CLS达到88.73%，介于Qwen-4B(88.43%)和Qwen-8B(89.40%)之间，\n      符合6.7B参数量的预期——这证明CLS在不同架构上表现一致；\n      (2) 但CLS vs CWM gap仅0.52pp（远低于Qwen-4B的1.25pp和Qwen-8B的2.43pp），\n      因为DeepSeek-Coder的code generation能力使CWM受益更多——\n      CWM在DeepSeek上达到~88.2%（vs Qwen-4B的87.19%）；\n      (3) Gap trend变为non-monotonic：Qwen-4B 1.25pp → DeepSeek-6.7B 0.52pp → \n      Qwen-8B 2.43pp，无法claim \"gap随model size单调增长\"；\n      (4) 这意味着CLS vs CWM gap不是architecture-independent的，而是依赖于\n      base model的code generation pretraining quality——pretraining越强的模型\n      CWM受益越多，gap越小。\n      Reviewer会据此质疑\"formulation advantage\"是否只是Qwen-specific artifact。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Cross-architecture CLS vs CWM comparison (function-level)\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Size\", \"CLS Acc %\", \"CWM Acc %\", \"Gap (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3\", \"4B\", 88.43, 87.19, \"+1.25\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-Coder\", \"6.7B\", 88.73, 88.21, \"+0.52\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3\", \"8B\", 89.40, 86.96, \"+2.43\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: CLS vs CWM accuracy across three model configs, showing non-monotonic gap\"\n      - \"Scatter plot: model size vs CLS-CWM gap, showing DeepSeek as outlier below Qwen trend line\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek的小gap直接削弱了\"classification scales better with model size\"的claim。\n      在worst档pivot论文中，这变为characterization finding：\"CLS-CWM gap depends on \n      base model's code generation capability, not just formulation\"。\n      这实际上加强了complementarity角度——如果gap是architecture-dependent，\n      那么在不同模型上CLS和CWM的failure modes更可能不同，ensemble更有价值。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek-Coder CWM Function-Level (seed default)\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-cwm-func\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA CWM generation baseline，\n      function-level。已完成训练（eval_loss=0.04292），待测试集评估。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_accuracy: 88.21\n      pass_f1: 88.10\n      fail_f1: 88.32\n      pass_precision: 91.20\n      pass_recall: 85.20\n      fail_precision: 85.40\n      fail_recall: 91.40\n      exact_match_rate: 85.50\n      train_loss_final: 0.0986\n      eval_loss: 0.04292\n      train_runtime_sec: 5215\n      unparseable: 0\n      vs_qwen4b_cwm_gap_pp: 0.70\n      vs_qwen8b_cwm_gap_pp: 0.54\n    result_rationale: >\n      DeepSeek-CWM在function-level达到88.21%，高于Qwen-4B CWM(87.51%)和\n      Qwen-8B CWM(87.67%)。原因：\n      (1) DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B的eval_loss(0.043)显著低于Qwen-4B CWM(0.064)和\n      Qwen-8B CWM(0.055)，说明code-specialized pretraining让generation target\n      更容易拟合；\n      (2) Exact match rate 85.5%（vs Qwen-4B的84.02%），更多predictions能\n      完美复现execution output字面值；\n      (3) 这些output精确度的提升直接转化为分类准确率的提升——CWM的accuracy\n      上限受限于exact match quality；\n      (4) 但与DeepSeek-CLS(88.73%)相比gap仅0.52pp，确认了在code-specialized\n      模型上classification advantage最小化。\n      Worst档叙事：DeepSeek的CWM强表现证明\"CWM failure modes at function-level\"\n      不是因为generation inherently harder，而是因为base model的generation \n      capability不同。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"CWM generation accuracy across architectures\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Size\", \"CWM Acc %\", \"Exact Match %\", \"Eval Loss\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3\", \"4B\", 87.51, 84.02, 0.064]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-Coder\", \"6.7B\", 88.21, 85.50, 0.043]\n          - [\"Qwen3\", \"8B\", 87.67, 84.39, 0.055]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: CWM accuracy across architectures, showing DeepSeek highest despite smaller size than 8B\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek-CWM的优异表现是worst档的关键evidence：如果一个code-specialized\n      6.7B模型的CWM能match其CLS，那么CWM的\"difficulty\"不是generation task\n      的inherent property，而是base model capability的function。\n      论文pivot：不再claim \"generation is harder than classification\"，\n      改为\"the relative difficulty depends on the model's generation capability\"。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek-Coder CWM Function-Level seed=123\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-cwm-func-s123\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B CWM function-level with seed=123，\n      用于multi-seed validation of DeepSeek CWM results。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_accuracy: 87.88\n      pass_f1: 87.75\n      fail_f1: 88.00\n      exact_match_rate: 85.10\n      eval_loss: 0.0445\n      train_runtime_sec: 5300\n      unparseable: 0\n      seed_default_accuracy: 88.21\n      seed_123_accuracy: 87.88\n      seed_gap_pp: 0.33\n      deepseek_cwm_mean_2seed: 88.05\n      deepseek_cwm_std_2seed: 0.23\n    result_rationale: >\n      Seed=123与default seed的差异仅0.33pp（87.88% vs 88.21%），在正常\n      seed variance范围内（std ~0.23pp，低于Qwen-4B CWM的seed std ~0.35pp）。\n      DeepSeek-Coder的更低variance可能因为：(1) code-specialized pretraining提供了\n      更稳定的初始化，LoRA微调的随机性影响更小；(2) 6.7B参数量比4B有更多冗余，\n      对随机seed的敏感度更低。\n      两个seed的mean(88.05%)确认DeepSeek-CWM稳定优于Qwen-4B CWM(87.19%)，\n      但仅2个seed不足以做严格的statistical comparison。\n      Worst档影响：reviewer可能要求3-5个seed才接受architecture comparison claim，\n      仅2个seed被视为insufficient evidence。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"DeepSeek CWM multi-seed results (function-level)\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"Accuracy %\", \"Exact Match %\", \"Eval Loss\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"default\", 88.21, 85.50, 0.0429]\n          - [\"123\", 87.88, 85.10, 0.0445]\n          - [\"Mean±Std\", \"88.05±0.23\", \"85.30±0.28\", \"0.0437±0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dot plot: DeepSeek CWM seed variability vs Qwen CWM seed variability\"\n    analysis: >\n      两个seed结果一致但sample size不足。Worst档下reviewer会说\n      \"2 seeds is anecdotal, not statistical\"，要求至少3个seed。\n      如果deadline前无法补跑，DeepSeek comparison只能作为supplementary\n      observation而非formal claim。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek-Coder CLS Repo-Level\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-cls-repo\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA classification在repo-level\n      SWE-bench数据上训练。验证repo-level CLS是否generalize across architectures。\n    expected_results:\n      best_checkpoint_accuracy: 78.15\n      best_checkpoint_f1_macro: 69.82\n      best_checkpoint_fail_f1: 55.30\n      best_checkpoint_pass_f1: 84.34\n      fail_precision: 72.50\n      fail_recall: 44.60\n      pass_precision: 79.80\n      pass_recall: 89.50\n      unparseable_pct: 1.8\n      majority_baseline: 72.96\n      gap_vs_majority_pp: 5.19\n      vs_qwen4b_repo_cls_accuracy_diff_pp: -4.20\n      vs_qwen8b_repo_cls_accuracy_diff_pp: -5.37\n      overfitting_epoch: 2\n      eval_loss_trend: \"U-shaped, minimum at step 400-600\"\n      train_time_sec: 18000\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst档核心假设：\"Repo-level CLS accuracy <80%或seed间variance>5pp\"。\n      DeepSeek-CLS-repo达到78.15%（低于Qwen-4B的82.35%和Qwen-8B的83.52%），\n      原因：\n      (1) DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B虽然是code-specialized模型，但其pretraining\n      偏向code generation而非code understanding/classification——repo-level\n      的pass/fail判断需要理解长上下文中的语义一致性，这是code understanding任务；\n      (2) Repo-level input长度（5120-8192 tokens）对6.7B模型的attention capacity\n      构成挑战——DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B的有效context window可能不如Qwen3-8B；\n      (3) LoRA rank=16可能对6.7B模型insufficient——Qwen实验中同样rank=16，\n      但Qwen3架构可能更LoRA-friendly（GQA vs MHA差异）；\n      (4) 78.15%仅比majority baseline(73%)高5pp，在worst档范围[75,80]中部，\n      reviewer会质疑这个marginal improvement是否justify the fine-tuning cost；\n      (5) fail_f1仅55.30%，说明模型在识别failing tests方面表现差——这正是\n      per-test verification最需要的能力。\n      \n      关键影响：DeepSeek在repo-level表现更差（vs function-level的88.73%），\n      drop幅度10.58pp（vs Qwen-4B的5.72pp from 88.43→82.35），说明\n      DeepSeek在domain transfer (func→repo) 上比Qwen更脆弱。\n      这进一步复杂化了architecture comparison story——不同架构在不同\n      complexity level上的ranking不同。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Repo-level CLS across architectures\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Size\", \"Accuracy %\", \"Fail F1 %\", \"Gap vs Majority (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3\", \"4B\", 82.35, 60.87, \"+9.39\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-Coder\", \"6.7B\", 78.15, 55.30, \"+5.19\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3\", \"8B\", 83.52, 65.85, \"+10.56\"]\n      - caption: \"Function-to-repo performance drop by architecture\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Func Acc %\", \"Repo Acc %\", \"Drop (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3-4B\", 88.43, 82.35, \"-6.08\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-6.7B\", 88.73, 78.15, \"-10.58\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-8B\", 89.40, 83.52, \"-5.88\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: function-level vs repo-level accuracy by architecture, showing non-parallel drops\"\n      - \"Heatmap: architecture × complexity level → accuracy, showing DeepSeek's disproportionate repo-level drop\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek在repo-level的相对劣势是worst档最damaging的finding之一。\n      它证明：(a) CLS formulation的effectiveness是architecture-dependent；\n      (b) code-specialized pretraining不自动转化为repo-level verification能力；\n      (c) 不同架构在function-level vs repo-level的ranking反转（DeepSeek func > \n      Qwen-4B func, 但DeepSeek repo < Qwen-4B repo）。\n      论文必须降级architecture comparison为\"preliminary observation\"，\n      承认需要更多架构（CodeLlama, StarCoder等）才能draw conclusions。\n\n  - name: \"Repo-Level CLS Multi-Seed Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"repo-level-training\"\n    description: >\n      Repo-level CLS的multi-seed validation（seed42已完成，预测seed123/456结果）。\n      验证repo-level结果的稳定性。\n    expected_results:\n      seed42_accuracy: 82.35\n      seed42_fail_f1: 60.87\n      seed123_accuracy: 77.80\n      seed123_fail_f1: 53.20\n      seed456_accuracy: 79.50\n      seed456_fail_f1: 57.40\n      multiseed_mean_accuracy: 79.88\n      multiseed_std_accuracy: 2.32\n      multiseed_mean_fail_f1: 57.16\n      multiseed_std_fail_f1: 3.87\n      seed_range_accuracy_pp: 4.55\n      seed42_vs_mean_diff_pp: 2.47\n      cls_vs_cwm_repo_gap_pp: \"undefined (CWM repo failed)\"\n      reviewer_concern_seed_variance: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst档核心指标：repo_cls_accuracy_multiseed在[75,80]，repo_cls_fail_f1在[50,62]。\n      Seed42的82.35%是cherry-picked best seed：\n      (1) Seed123在repo-level的home server上已有partial results——cls4b-seed123-ckpt800\n      val5120准确率87.92%（validation），但test准确率仅75.33%（大幅val-test gap，\n      9784 samples），说明该seed严重过拟合；\n      (2) Seed456预计79.50%——居中但低于seed42，因为不同random initialization\n      在repo-level的高维parameter space中找到不同local minima；\n      (3) Multi-seed mean 79.88%落入worst档[75,80]范围，std 2.32pp表示\n      moderate但不negligible的variance；\n      (4) Seed42比mean高2.47pp，reviewer会质疑是否report了best seed；\n      (5) Fail_f1 mean仅57.16%（std 3.87pp），说明模型对failing tests的识别\n      在不同seed间极不稳定——这是diagnostic value的致命缺陷；\n      (6) CWM repo-level实验全部failed（unparseable 53-93%），无法计算cls-cwm gap，\n      reviewer会归因于experimental design而非formulation差异。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Repo-level CLS multi-seed results (Qwen3-4B)\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"Accuracy %\", \"Fail F1 %\", \"Pass F1 %\", \"Unparseable %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [42, 82.35, 60.87, 89.59, 0.0]\n          - [123, 77.80, 53.20, 85.10, 1.5]\n          - [456, 79.50, 57.40, 87.30, 0.8]\n          - [\"Mean±Std\", \"79.88±2.32\", \"57.16±3.87\", \"87.33±2.25\", \"0.77±0.75\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Box plot: repo-level accuracy across seeds, showing wide spread and seed42 as outlier\"\n      - \"Scatter: seed-level accuracy vs fail_f1, showing positive correlation but high variance\"\n    analysis: >\n      Multi-seed mean 79.88%低于majority baseline+10pp threshold that reviewers\n      typically expect for \"meaningful\" improvement。Seed42的82.35%看起来decent\n      但它是3个seed中最好的——如果论文只报告seed42，reviewer会质疑cherry-picking。\n      报告3-seed mean则只有79.88%，不足以支撑strong repo-level claim。\n      Fail_f1的高variance（std 3.87pp）意味着per-test diagnostic在不同\n      random runs间不稳定——这与function-level（fail_f1 std ~0.92pp）形成鲜明对比。\n      在worst档pivot中，repo-level results降级为\"preliminary\"，\n      承认需要更多compute和hyperparameter tuning。\n\n  - name: \"Repo-Level CWM Revisited (Reviewer Challenge)\"\n    plan_id: \"repo-level-training\"\n    description: >\n      预测reviewer对repo-level CWM失败的质疑及重做实验的结果。\n      Reviewer会认为CWM failure是max_new_tokens/prompt设计导致，\n      要求增大token budget重做。\n    expected_results:\n      cwm_v10_accuracy: 69.91\n      cwm_v10_unparseable_pct: 93.0\n      cwm_v10_with_tok512_accuracy: 72.50\n      cwm_v10_with_tok512_unparseable_pct: 45.0\n      cwm_v10_with_tok1024_accuracy: 74.80\n      cwm_v10_with_tok1024_unparseable_pct: 28.0\n      cwm_v10_with_tok2048_accuracy: 75.50\n      cwm_v10_with_tok2048_unparseable_pct: 18.0\n      cwm_tok2048_vs_cls_gap_pp: -4.38\n      cwm_tok2048_inference_cost_ratio: 35.0\n      reviewer_satisfied: false\n      rebuttal_risk: \"high\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst档假设：\"Reviewer将CWM repo-level failure归因于max_new_tokens/prompt设计，\n      要求重做实验\"。实际已有的cwm-v10结果：accuracy 69.91%但93%unparseable。\n      Reviewer的合理质疑：\n      (1) max_new_tokens=64（D047记录）导致93% unparseable——这是obvious \n      experimental error，不是formulation的inherent limitation；\n      (2) 增大token budget到512后unparseable降至~45%，accuracy升至72.50%——\n      说明CWM failure是token budget artifact而非fundamental；\n      (3) 进一步增至1024 (28% unparseable, 74.80%) 和2048 (18%, 75.50%)，\n      CWM持续改善，但改善速度递减（diminishing returns）；\n      (4) 即使tok=2048，CWM仍低于CLS mean(79.88%) 约4.38pp——但这个gap\n      可能是因为CWM还可以进一步优化（prompt format、更大token budget、\n      post-processing）；\n      (5) Reviewer会说：\"You set up CWM to fail by limiting tokens. \n      A fair comparison needs CWM with sufficient token budget.\"——\n      即使我们argue CWM的高token cost是formulation的inherent cost，\n      reviewer关心的是accuracy comparison是否fair，not cost。\n      \n      CWM-tok2048的35x inference cost是efficiency argument的支撑，\n      但worst档下reviewer可能不买账：\"efficiency without accuracy parity \n      is not a contribution\"。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Repo-level CWM accuracy vs token budget (Qwen3-4B)\"\n        columns: [\"max_new_tokens\", \"Accuracy %\", \"Unparseable %\", \"Δ vs CLS mean (pp)\", \"Inference Cost (×)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [64, 69.91, 93.0, \"-9.97\", \"1.5×\"]\n          - [512, 72.50, 45.0, \"-7.38\", \"8×\"]\n          - [1024, 74.80, 28.0, \"-5.08\", \"16×\"]\n          - [2048, 75.50, 18.0, \"-4.38\", \"35×\"]\n          - [\"CLS (1 token)\", 79.88, 0.0, \"—\", \"1×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: CWM accuracy vs token budget, showing diminishing returns curve approaching but not reaching CLS\"\n      - \"Dual-axis: accuracy (left) and unparseable rate (right) vs token budget, showing tradeoff\"\n    analysis: >\n      Token budget sweep是worst档rebuttal的核心风险。即使CWM-tok2048的accuracy\n      仍低于CLS，4.38pp gap在reviewer眼中可能\"来自其他confounds而非formulation\"。\n      在pivot论文中，这变为efficiency-accuracy tradeoff analysis：\n      CLS用1-token达到CWM 2048-token的更高accuracy——这是genuine contribution\n      但需要careful framing避免being dismissed as \"unfair comparison\"。\n\n  - name: \"Error Complementarity Deep Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"matched-seed-8b-predictions\"\n    description: >\n      CLS和CWM在matched seeds上的error overlap分析。\n      已有4B seed42数据（oracle 90.63%），预测8B和multi-seed结果。\n    expected_results:\n      oracle_ensemble_4b_seed42: 90.63\n      oracle_ensemble_4b_5seed_mean: 90.25\n      oracle_ensemble_8b_seed42: 93.10\n      oracle_ensemble_8b_3seed_mean: 92.50\n      cls_only_correct_pct_4b: 3.12\n      cwm_only_correct_pct_4b: 2.80\n      both_wrong_pct_4b: 9.37\n      cls_only_correct_pct_8b: 4.50\n      cwm_only_correct_pct_8b: 2.10\n      both_wrong_pct_8b: 4.40\n      cls_fn_dominance_pct: 75.5\n      cwm_fp_dominance_pct: 83.1\n      kappa_predictions_4b: 0.88\n      kappa_correctness_4b: 0.73\n      kappa_predictions_8b: 0.82\n      kappa_correctness_8b: 0.65\n      practical_ensemble_accuracy_4b: 88.90\n      practical_ensemble_accuracy_8b: 91.20\n      ensemble_vs_oracle_gap_4b_pp: 1.73\n      ensemble_vs_oracle_gap_8b_pp: 1.90\n    result_rationale: >\n      Error complementarity是worst档pivot叙事的三大支柱之一。\n      4B seed42的已有数据：oracle 90.63%（both correct 84.71%, CLS-only 3.12%, \n      CWM-only 2.80%, both wrong 9.37%）。\n      \n      Worst档下的补充预测：\n      (1) 4B 5-seed mean oracle降至90.25%——某些seeds的CLS/CWM errors更相关\n      （overlap更大），削弱complementarity；\n      (2) 8B oracle升至93.10%，因为8B models各自更强（fewer errors）但complementarity\n      pattern保持——CLS-only(4.5%) > CWM-only(2.1%)说明CWM的8B improvement\n      更多来自修正CWM-specific errors；\n      (3) CLS FN dominance 75.5%和CWM FP dominance 83.1%在不同seeds间\n      保持稳定（±3pp），说明这是formulation-level的systematic pattern而非\n      random artifact——这是worst档pivot的strongest evidence；\n      (4) Practical ensemble（simple voting而非oracle）只达到88.90%/91.20%，\n      低于oracle 1.73pp/1.90pp，说明error complementarity存在但\n      simple aggregation无法fully exploit它；\n      (5) Kappa(correctness)在8B下降至0.65（vs 4B的0.73），说明8B models\n      的errors更diverse——更多potential for complementarity但也更难aggregate。\n      \n      Worst档叙事：error complementarity是最robust的finding，不受\n      cls-vs-cwm accuracy comparison结果的影响。即使CLS≈CWM in accuracy，\n      它们的failure modes仍systematically不同，这本身就是有价值的characterization。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Error overlap analysis (function-level, matched seeds)\"\n        columns: [\"Category\", \"4B seed42 (%)\", \"4B 5-seed mean (%)\", \"8B 3-seed mean (%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Both correct\", 84.71, 84.35, 89.00]\n          - [\"CLS-only correct\", 3.12, 2.95, 4.50]\n          - [\"CWM-only correct\", 2.80, 2.65, 2.10]\n          - [\"Both wrong\", 9.37, 10.05, 4.40]\n          - [\"Oracle ensemble\", 90.63, 90.25, 93.10]\n      - caption: \"Error type asymmetry (CLS vs CWM)\"\n        columns: [\"Error Type\", \"CLS (%)\", \"CWM (%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"False Negative (miss bug)\", 75.5, 16.9]\n          - [\"False Positive (false alarm)\", 24.5, 83.1]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram: CLS errors vs CWM errors showing limited overlap\"\n      - \"Stacked bar: error type breakdown for CLS vs CWM showing complementary asymmetry\"\n      - \"Line plot: oracle ensemble accuracy across seeds, showing stability\"\n    analysis: >\n      Error complementarity在worst档下是最defensible的contribution。\n      它不依赖于CLS > CWM的claim——即使CLS ≈ CWM，它们fail on different \n      instances in predictable ways (CLS: conservative → miss bugs; \n      CWM: noisy generation → false alarms)。Oracle ensemble 90.63%\n      作为upper bound motivates future work on learned ensemble strategies。\n      在pivot论文中，这可以成为Section 5: \"Complementary Failure Modes \n      as a Verification Strategy\"的核心内容。\n\n  - name: \"Efficiency Equivalence Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"inference-cost-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      CLS (1-token) vs CWM (N-token) 的inference cost对比。\n      已有CPU数据（3.1x token overhead, 1.09x latency），\n      预测GPU场景和repo-level scaling。\n    expected_results:\n      func_level_cpu:\n        cls_output_tokens_mean: 2.0\n        cwm_output_tokens_mean: 6.2\n        token_ratio: 3.1\n        latency_ratio: 1.09\n        throughput_ratio: 0.92\n      func_level_gpu:\n        cls_latency_ms: 45\n        cwm_latency_ms: 85\n        latency_ratio: 1.89\n        cls_throughput_sps: 22.2\n        cwm_throughput_sps: 11.8\n        throughput_ratio: 1.88\n      repo_level_gpu:\n        cls_output_tokens: 2\n        cwm_output_tokens_mean: 45\n        cwm_output_tokens_p95: 180\n        token_ratio: 22.5\n        cls_latency_ms: 320\n        cwm_latency_ms: 2800\n        latency_ratio: 8.75\n        cls_throughput_sps: 3.1\n        cwm_throughput_sps: 0.36\n        throughput_ratio: 8.6\n      batch_inference_1000_instances:\n        cls_total_time_min: 5.4\n        cwm_total_time_min: 46.3\n        speedup: 8.6\n      cost_per_1000_instances_a100:\n        cls_cost_usd: 0.05\n        cwm_cost_usd: 0.43\n        cost_ratio: 8.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Efficiency equivalence是worst档pivot的angle之一：\"CLS用1-token output\n      达到CWM N-token相同accuracy，inference cost降低\"。\n      \n      已有CPU数据显示仅1.09x latency差异，因为prefill dominates——但这\n      低估了real-world GPU差异：\n      (1) Function-level GPU：prefill仍dominates但per-token decode在GPU上\n      更parallel-efficient，CWM的6.2 mean output tokens导致1.89x latency——\n      比CPU的1.09x更明显但仍不dramatic，因为function-level outputs很短；\n      (2) Repo-level GPU：CWM output tokens mean=45 (p95=180)，latency ratio\n      升至8.75x——这是efficiency argument的sweet spot；\n      (3) 但worst档下accuracy comparison存疑（CLS 79.88% vs CWM ~75.50%@tok2048），\n      reviewer会说\"efficiency comparison only meaningful at accuracy parity\"；\n      (4) Batch inference场景：1000 instances处理时间CLS 5.4min vs CWM 46.3min，\n      8.6x speedup——在best-of-N verification pipeline中（K=16 candidates × \n      T=15 tests = 240 predictions per instance），CLS的low latency is genuinely \n      valuable for interactive repair workflows。\n      \n      Worst档影响：efficiency argument在function-level很弱（1.09-1.89x），\n      只在repo-level显著（8.75x）。但repo-level accuracy不足使得efficiency\n      claim变为\"faster at a task it doesn't do well at\"——需要careful framing。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Inference cost comparison: CLS vs CWM\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"CLS Latency\", \"CWM Latency\", \"Speedup\", \"Accuracy Gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Func-level CPU\", \"9.76s\", \"10.61s\", \"1.09×\", \"~0pp\"]\n          - [\"Func-level GPU\", \"45ms\", \"85ms\", \"1.89×\", \"~1.25pp\"]\n          - [\"Repo-level GPU\", \"320ms\", \"2.8s\", \"8.75×\", \"~4.38pp\"]\n      - caption: \"Cost projection: 1000-instance verification (A100)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Time (min)\", \"Cost (USD)\", \"Accuracy (%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CLS (repo)\", 5.4, \"$0.05\", 79.88]\n          - [\"CWM tok-2048 (repo)\", 46.3, \"$0.43\", 75.50]\n          - [\"CWM tok-512 (repo)\", 12.1, \"$0.11\", 72.50]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto frontier: accuracy vs inference cost for CLS, CWM at various token budgets, and LLM-judge baselines\"\n      - \"Bar chart: speedup ratio across complexity levels (func vs repo)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Efficiency是worst档中唯一的\"clear win\" for CLS——但只在repo-level显著。\n      Pareto frontier图将是论文的key figure之一：CLS dominates at every cost level。\n      但reviewer可能要求CWM with unlimited tokens作为accuracy upper bound，\n      如果CWM with sufficient tokens matches CLS accuracy，efficiency argument\n      reduces to \"same accuracy, lower cost\"——这是less exciting但still valid contribution。\n```\n\n总结：worst档下的核心转变是从\"CLS > CWM\"到\"CLS ≈ CWM with complementary failure modes\"。8个imagined experiments覆盖了：\n- 2个planned实验（diagnostic-rerepair、swebench-pertest-data）\n- 4个running DeepSeek实验\n- 2个implied实验（repo-level multi-seed、efficiency analysis）\n\n最致命的findings：(1) DeepSeek CLS-CWM gap仅0.52pp，削弱architecture-independence；(2) repo-level multi-seed mean ~80%，seed variance ~2.3pp；(3) re-repair gain仅+0.5pp，not significant。最robust的贡献：error complementarity（oracle 90.63%）和efficiency Pareto dominance。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1939,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5570,"cache_read_input_tokens":62088,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5570},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"23fb2834-2812-4457-b569-54861da1d013","uuid":"a4e1d87a-3f7b-4689-90b7-cdeb47eb26df"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":459595,"duration_api_ms":504684,"num_turns":5,"result":"Now I have all the context needed. Let me construct the comprehensive worst-tier predictions.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Pivot到三个互补angle: (1) Efficiency equivalence——CLS用1-token output达到CWM N-token\n  相同accuracy，inference cost降低3-10x (GPU场景更显著); (2) Oracle characterization——\n  empirically grounded decision framework for when per-test helps (T≥2, regression \n  rate≥10%, block-correlated errors); (3) Error complementarity——CLS/CWM failure modes\n  系统性互补（CLS漏报75.5%, CWM误报83.1%），oracle ensemble 90.63%，suggesting formulation \n  diversity as verification strategy。不再claim 'classification is better'，改为\n  'classification and generation are complementary formulations with predictable failure \n  modes'。仍冲EMNLP main作为empirical characterization paper（类似analysis track），\n  fallback Findings。Repo-level evidence不足：multi-seed mean accuracy 77-79%，seed间\n  variance 4-6pp，reviewer会要求额外seed或质疑prompt设计。DeepSeek实验显示不同pattern，\n  削弱architecture-independence claim——改为honest reporting \"gap is architecture-dependent, \n  further investigation needed\"。Per-test diagnostic value降级为theoretical argument \n  with oracle ceiling analysis（无re-repair实证）。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Diagnostic Re-repair Experiment\"\n    plan_id: \"diagnostic-rerepair\"\n    description: >\n      给修复代理提供per-test failure predictions vs 无per-test信息，\n      在200个instances上比较resolve rate。使用SWE-agent框架，\n      classification模型提供per-test诊断。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_resolve_rate_pct: 29.0\n      with_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pct: 29.5\n      resolve_rate_gain_pp: 0.5\n      gain_significant_at_005: false\n      mcnemar_p_value: 0.72\n      instances_helped_by_diagnostic: 5\n      instances_hurt_by_diagnostic: 4\n      net_helped: 1\n      diagnostic_precision_on_helped: 0.80\n      diagnostic_precision_on_hurt: 0.60\n      oracle_diagnostic_resolve_rate_pct: 33.5\n      oracle_vs_baseline_gain_pp: 4.5\n      oracle_vs_predicted_gap_pp: 4.0\n      time_cost_per_instance_baseline_min: 8.2\n      time_cost_per_instance_diagnostic_min: 8.5\n      T1_instances_in_200: 137\n      T1_gain_pp: 0.0\n      T2plus_instances_in_200: 63\n      T2plus_gain_pp: 1.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst档假设\"无downstream re-repair实验，per-test diagnostic value仅为theoretical \n      argument\"。即使勉强跑完实验，gain仅+0.5pp（29.5% vs 29.0%），原因：\n      (1) 200个instances中~137个(68.7%)是T=1，per-test信息与trajectory-level数学等价，\n      诊断信号零增益；\n      (2) 剩余63个T≥2 instances中，per-test prediction precision ~80%意味着每5个predicted-fail\n      中约1个是误报——修复代理基于错误诊断做了无效修复尝试（4个instances被误导）；\n      (3) 仅5个instances中诊断真正帮助定位了具体失败测试并引导修复成功——但这些大多是\n      T=2且两个测试failure mode清晰分离的\"easy\"案例；\n      (4) Oracle上界（33.5%）显示per-test信息在完美条件下有价值（+4.5pp），但predicted \n      diagnostic仅能实现11%的oracle ceiling（0.5/4.5）；\n      (5) McNemar p=0.72，远不显著——200个instances的power不足以检测<1pp的差异。\n      这个结果在worst档叙事中将Claim 2完全降级为theoretical argument。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Diagnostic re-repair: predicted vs oracle per-test information\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"Resolve Rate (%)\", \"Δ vs Baseline (pp)\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"No diagnostic (baseline)\", 29.0, \"—\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Predicted per-test diagnostic\", 29.5, \"+0.5\", \"0.72\"]\n          - [\"Oracle per-test (ceiling)\", 33.5, \"+4.5\", \"0.02\"]\n      - caption: \"Re-repair gain stratified by F2P test count\"\n        columns: [\"T bucket\", \"N instances\", \"Baseline resolve %\", \"Diagnostic resolve %\", \"Δ pp\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"T=1\", 137, 30.7, 30.7, \"0.0\"]\n          - [\"T=2\", 40, 25.0, 27.5, \"+2.5\"]\n          - [\"T≥3\", 23, 21.7, 21.7, \"0.0\"]\n          - [\"All\", 200, 29.0, 29.5, \"+0.5\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: three conditions (baseline, predicted, oracle) showing oracle ceiling vs achievable gain, with error bars from bootstrap\"\n      - \"Scatter plot: per-instance diagnostic precision vs re-repair success, showing no correlation (r=0.04)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Oracle ceiling（+4.5pp）与predicted gain（+0.5pp）之间的巨大gap（4.0pp）\n      证实了worst档的核心论断：per-test诊断的价值是真实的但目前prediction quality\n      不足以释放这个价值。在pivot论文中，这成为\"future work\"的明确方向——\n      提升per-test prediction precision到>90%可能释放更多oracle ceiling。\n      但当前实验结论是negative：predicted diagnostics do not significantly \n      improve repair outcomes。\n\n  - name: \"SWE-bench Per-Test Dataset Construction\"\n    plan_id: \"swebench-pertest-data\"\n    description: >\n      Docker重新评估SWE-bench Verified patches，提取per-test labels。\n      构建SWE-bench-PerTest数据集（500 instances × 16 candidates）。\n    expected_results:\n      total_instances_attempted: 500\n      successful_evaluations: 458\n      failed_docker_builds: 27\n      timeout_evaluations: 15\n      total_candidate_test_pairs: 115872\n      avg_tests_per_instance: 15.8\n      avg_f2p_tests_per_instance: 2.1\n      median_f2p_tests: 1\n      pct_T1_instances: 71.2\n      pct_T2_instances: 16.8\n      pct_T3plus_instances: 12.0\n      avg_p2p_tests_per_instance: 13.7\n      pass_rate_overall: 0.73\n      fail_rate_overall: 0.27\n      p2p_regression_rate: 0.8\n      construction_time_hours: 24\n      gold_patch_all_pass_rate: 0.96\n      candidate_diversity_unique_test_signatures: 312\n    result_rationale: >\n      数据集构建是工程任务，worst档不影响技术成功率。但分布特征在worst档下\n      对论文叙事不利：\n      (1) T=1占71.2%（高于function-level oracle sim的68.7%），意味着repo-level\n      数据中per-test粒度的理论优势更稀薄——超过7成instances只有1个F2P测试；\n      (2) median F2P=1确认了T=1 mode的dominance；\n      (3) P2P regression rate仅0.8%（远低于oracle sim中reg≥10%的threshold），\n      意味着PASS_TO_PASS测试几乎不提供额外信号——patch极少破坏已通过的测试；\n      (4) overall pass rate 73%意味着class imbalance加剧（vs function-level ~50:50），\n      majority baseline就有73%，fine-tuned模型需要beat这个high baseline；\n      (5) 42/500 instances因Docker build failure或timeout丢失（8.4%），\n      可能引入selection bias——失败的往往是环境最复杂的instances，恰恰是\n      per-test可能最有价值的instances。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"SWE-bench-PerTest dataset statistics\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Instances (successful)\", 458]\n          - [\"Candidates per instance (mean)\", 16]\n          - [\"Total (code, test) pairs\", \"115,872\"]\n          - [\"F2P tests per instance (mean / median)\", \"2.1 / 1\"]\n          - [\"P2P tests per instance (mean)\", 13.7]\n          - [\"T=1 instances\", \"71.2%\"]\n          - [\"T≥2 instances\", \"28.8%\"]\n          - [\"Overall pass rate\", \"73%\"]\n          - [\"P2P regression rate\", \"0.8%\"]\n      - caption: \"F2P test count distribution\"\n        columns: [\"T\", \"% Instances\", \"Cumulative %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [1, 71.2, 71.2]\n          - [2, 16.8, 88.0]\n          - [3, 5.2, 93.2]\n          - [\"4-5\", 3.8, 97.0]\n          - [\"6+\", 3.0, 100.0]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Histogram: F2P test count distribution showing strong T=1 mode with long tail\"\n      - \"Box plot: per-instance test count (F2P vs P2P) showing P2P >> F2P\"\n    analysis: >\n      数据集本身作为resource contribution有独立价值。但worst档下的分布特征\n      系统性地削弱per-test方法的pitch：T=1主导+低regression rate意味着\n      大多数instances中per-test粒度退化为trajectory-level等价。\n      73%的pass rate使得\"预测fail\"成为稀有事件检测问题，precision-recall\n      tradeoff更不利。论文需诚实报告这些分布特征并作为characterization贡献。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek-Coder CLS Function-Level\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-cls-func\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA (rank=16, alpha=32) 在function-level\n      数据上训练classification (pass/fail)。验证CLS formulation是否\n      architecture-independent。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_accuracy: 88.73\n      pass_f1: 88.85\n      fail_f1: 88.60\n      pass_precision: 90.50\n      pass_recall: 87.25\n      fail_precision: 87.00\n      fail_recall: 90.30\n      train_loss: 0.210\n      eval_loss: 0.075\n      train_runtime_sec: 4800\n      unparseable: 0\n      cls_vs_cwm_gap_deepseek_pp: 0.52\n      cls_vs_cwm_gap_qwen4b_pp: 1.25\n      cls_vs_cwm_gap_qwen8b_pp: 2.43\n      gap_trend_with_size: \"non-monotonic\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst档核心假设：\"DeepSeek实验显示不同pattern，削弱architecture-independence claim\"。\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B是code-specialized模型（vs Qwen3通用模型），其预训练数据\n      包含大量代码执行trace，这使得CWM (generation)任务对DeepSeek相对更容易：\n      (1) DeepSeek-CLS达到88.73%，介于Qwen-4B(88.43%)和Qwen-8B(89.40%)之间，\n      符合6.7B参数量的预期——这证明CLS在不同架构上表现一致；\n      (2) 但CLS vs CWM gap仅0.52pp（远低于Qwen-4B的1.25pp和Qwen-8B的2.43pp），\n      因为DeepSeek-Coder的code generation能力使CWM受益更多——\n      CWM在DeepSeek上达到~88.2%（vs Qwen-4B的87.19%）；\n      (3) Gap trend变为non-monotonic：Qwen-4B 1.25pp → DeepSeek-6.7B 0.52pp → \n      Qwen-8B 2.43pp，无法claim \"gap随model size单调增长\"；\n      (4) 这意味着CLS vs CWM gap不是architecture-independent的，而是依赖于\n      base model的code generation pretraining quality——pretraining越强的模型\n      CWM受益越多，gap越小。\n      Reviewer会据此质疑\"formulation advantage\"是否只是Qwen-specific artifact。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Cross-architecture CLS vs CWM comparison (function-level)\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Size\", \"CLS Acc %\", \"CWM Acc %\", \"Gap (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3\", \"4B\", 88.43, 87.19, \"+1.25\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-Coder\", \"6.7B\", 88.73, 88.21, \"+0.52\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3\", \"8B\", 89.40, 86.96, \"+2.43\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: CLS vs CWM accuracy across three model configs, showing non-monotonic gap\"\n      - \"Scatter plot: model size vs CLS-CWM gap, showing DeepSeek as outlier below Qwen trend line\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek的小gap直接削弱了\"classification scales better with model size\"的claim。\n      在worst档pivot论文中，这变为characterization finding：\"CLS-CWM gap depends on \n      base model's code generation capability, not just formulation\"。\n      这实际上加强了complementarity角度——如果gap是architecture-dependent，\n      那么在不同模型上CLS和CWM的failure modes更可能不同，ensemble更有价值。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek-Coder CWM Function-Level (seed default)\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-cwm-func\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA CWM generation baseline，\n      function-level。已完成训练（eval_loss=0.04292），待测试集评估。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_accuracy: 88.21\n      pass_f1: 88.10\n      fail_f1: 88.32\n      pass_precision: 91.20\n      pass_recall: 85.20\n      fail_precision: 85.40\n      fail_recall: 91.40\n      exact_match_rate: 85.50\n      train_loss_final: 0.0986\n      eval_loss: 0.04292\n      train_runtime_sec: 5215\n      unparseable: 0\n      vs_qwen4b_cwm_gap_pp: 0.70\n      vs_qwen8b_cwm_gap_pp: 0.54\n    result_rationale: >\n      DeepSeek-CWM在function-level达到88.21%，高于Qwen-4B CWM(87.51%)和\n      Qwen-8B CWM(87.67%)。原因：\n      (1) DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B的eval_loss(0.043)显著低于Qwen-4B CWM(0.064)和\n      Qwen-8B CWM(0.055)，说明code-specialized pretraining让generation target\n      更容易拟合；\n      (2) Exact match rate 85.5%（vs Qwen-4B的84.02%），更多predictions能\n      完美复现execution output字面值；\n      (3) 这些output精确度的提升直接转化为分类准确率的提升——CWM的accuracy\n      上限受限于exact match quality；\n      (4) 但与DeepSeek-CLS(88.73%)相比gap仅0.52pp，确认了在code-specialized\n      模型上classification advantage最小化。\n      Worst档叙事：DeepSeek的CWM强表现证明\"CWM failure modes at function-level\"\n      不是因为generation inherently harder，而是因为base model的generation \n      capability不同。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"CWM generation accuracy across architectures\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Size\", \"CWM Acc %\", \"Exact Match %\", \"Eval Loss\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3\", \"4B\", 87.51, 84.02, 0.064]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-Coder\", \"6.7B\", 88.21, 85.50, 0.043]\n          - [\"Qwen3\", \"8B\", 87.67, 84.39, 0.055]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart: CWM accuracy across architectures, showing DeepSeek highest despite smaller size than 8B\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek-CWM的优异表现是worst档的关键evidence：如果一个code-specialized\n      6.7B模型的CWM能match其CLS，那么CWM的\"difficulty\"不是generation task\n      的inherent property，而是base model capability的function。\n      论文pivot：不再claim \"generation is harder than classification\"，\n      改为\"the relative difficulty depends on the model's generation capability\"。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek-Coder CWM Function-Level seed=123\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-cwm-func-s123\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B CWM function-level with seed=123，\n      用于multi-seed validation of DeepSeek CWM results。\n    expected_results:\n      overall_accuracy: 87.88\n      pass_f1: 87.75\n      fail_f1: 88.00\n      exact_match_rate: 85.10\n      eval_loss: 0.0445\n      train_runtime_sec: 5300\n      unparseable: 0\n      seed_default_accuracy: 88.21\n      seed_123_accuracy: 87.88\n      seed_gap_pp: 0.33\n      deepseek_cwm_mean_2seed: 88.05\n      deepseek_cwm_std_2seed: 0.23\n    result_rationale: >\n      Seed=123与default seed的差异仅0.33pp（87.88% vs 88.21%），在正常\n      seed variance范围内（std ~0.23pp，低于Qwen-4B CWM的seed std ~0.35pp）。\n      DeepSeek-Coder的更低variance可能因为：(1) code-specialized pretraining提供了\n      更稳定的初始化，LoRA微调的随机性影响更小；(2) 6.7B参数量比4B有更多冗余，\n      对随机seed的敏感度更低。\n      两个seed的mean(88.05%)确认DeepSeek-CWM稳定优于Qwen-4B CWM(87.19%)，\n      但仅2个seed不足以做严格的statistical comparison。\n      Worst档影响：reviewer可能要求3-5个seed才接受architecture comparison claim，\n      仅2个seed被视为insufficient evidence。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"DeepSeek CWM multi-seed results (function-level)\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"Accuracy %\", \"Exact Match %\", \"Eval Loss\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"default\", 88.21, 85.50, 0.0429]\n          - [\"123\", 87.88, 85.10, 0.0445]\n          - [\"Mean±Std\", \"88.05±0.23\", \"85.30±0.28\", \"0.0437±0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dot plot: DeepSeek CWM seed variability vs Qwen CWM seed variability\"\n    analysis: >\n      两个seed结果一致但sample size不足。Worst档下reviewer会说\n      \"2 seeds is anecdotal, not statistical\"，要求至少3个seed。\n      如果deadline前无法补跑，DeepSeek comparison只能作为supplementary\n      observation而非formal claim。\n\n  - name: \"DeepSeek-Coder CLS Repo-Level\"\n    plan_id: \"deepseek-cls-repo\"\n    description: >\n      DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B-Instruct LoRA classification在repo-level\n      SWE-bench数据上训练。验证repo-level CLS是否generalize across architectures。\n    expected_results:\n      best_checkpoint_accuracy: 78.15\n      best_checkpoint_f1_macro: 69.82\n      best_checkpoint_fail_f1: 55.30\n      best_checkpoint_pass_f1: 84.34\n      fail_precision: 72.50\n      fail_recall: 44.60\n      pass_precision: 79.80\n      pass_recall: 89.50\n      unparseable_pct: 1.8\n      majority_baseline: 72.96\n      gap_vs_majority_pp: 5.19\n      vs_qwen4b_repo_cls_accuracy_diff_pp: -4.20\n      vs_qwen8b_repo_cls_accuracy_diff_pp: -5.37\n      overfitting_epoch: 2\n      eval_loss_trend: \"U-shaped, minimum at step 400-600\"\n      train_time_sec: 18000\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst档核心假设：\"Repo-level CLS accuracy <80%或seed间variance>5pp\"。\n      DeepSeek-CLS-repo达到78.15%（低于Qwen-4B的82.35%和Qwen-8B的83.52%），\n      原因：\n      (1) DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B虽然是code-specialized模型，但其pretraining\n      偏向code generation而非code understanding/classification——repo-level\n      的pass/fail判断需要理解长上下文中的语义一致性，这是code understanding任务；\n      (2) Repo-level input长度（5120-8192 tokens）对6.7B模型的attention capacity\n      构成挑战——DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B的有效context window可能不如Qwen3-8B；\n      (3) LoRA rank=16可能对6.7B模型insufficient——Qwen实验中同样rank=16，\n      但Qwen3架构可能更LoRA-friendly（GQA vs MHA差异）；\n      (4) 78.15%仅比majority baseline(73%)高5pp，在worst档范围[75,80]中部，\n      reviewer会质疑这个marginal improvement是否justify the fine-tuning cost；\n      (5) fail_f1仅55.30%，说明模型在识别failing tests方面表现差——这正是\n      per-test verification最需要的能力。\n      \n      关键影响：DeepSeek在repo-level表现更差（vs function-level的88.73%），\n      drop幅度10.58pp（vs Qwen-4B的5.72pp from 88.43→82.35），说明\n      DeepSeek在domain transfer (func→repo) 上比Qwen更脆弱。\n      这进一步复杂化了architecture comparison story——不同架构在不同\n      complexity level上的ranking不同。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Repo-level CLS across architectures\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Size\", \"Accuracy %\", \"Fail F1 %\", \"Gap vs Majority (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3\", \"4B\", 82.35, 60.87, \"+9.39\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-Coder\", \"6.7B\", 78.15, 55.30, \"+5.19\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3\", \"8B\", 83.52, 65.85, \"+10.56\"]\n      - caption: \"Function-to-repo performance drop by architecture\"\n        columns: [\"Architecture\", \"Func Acc %\", \"Repo Acc %\", \"Drop (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Qwen3-4B\", 88.43, 82.35, \"-6.08\"]\n          - [\"DeepSeek-6.7B\", 88.73, 78.15, \"-10.58\"]\n          - [\"Qwen3-8B\", 89.40, 83.52, \"-5.88\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: function-level vs repo-level accuracy by architecture, showing non-parallel drops\"\n      - \"Heatmap: architecture × complexity level → accuracy, showing DeepSeek's disproportionate repo-level drop\"\n    analysis: >\n      DeepSeek在repo-level的相对劣势是worst档最damaging的finding之一。\n      它证明：(a) CLS formulation的effectiveness是architecture-dependent；\n      (b) code-specialized pretraining不自动转化为repo-level verification能力；\n      (c) 不同架构在function-level vs repo-level的ranking反转（DeepSeek func > \n      Qwen-4B func, 但DeepSeek repo < Qwen-4B repo）。\n      论文必须降级architecture comparison为\"preliminary observation\"，\n      承认需要更多架构（CodeLlama, StarCoder等）才能draw conclusions。\n\n  - name: \"Repo-Level CLS Multi-Seed Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"repo-level-training\"\n    description: >\n      Repo-level CLS的multi-seed validation（seed42已完成，预测seed123/456结果）。\n      验证repo-level结果的稳定性。\n    expected_results:\n      seed42_accuracy: 82.35\n      seed42_fail_f1: 60.87\n      seed123_accuracy: 77.80\n      seed123_fail_f1: 53.20\n      seed456_accuracy: 79.50\n      seed456_fail_f1: 57.40\n      multiseed_mean_accuracy: 79.88\n      multiseed_std_accuracy: 2.32\n      multiseed_mean_fail_f1: 57.16\n      multiseed_std_fail_f1: 3.87\n      seed_range_accuracy_pp: 4.55\n      seed42_vs_mean_diff_pp: 2.47\n      cls_vs_cwm_repo_gap_pp: \"undefined (CWM repo failed)\"\n      reviewer_concern_seed_variance: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst档核心指标：repo_cls_accuracy_multiseed在[75,80]，repo_cls_fail_f1在[50,62]。\n      Seed42的82.35%是cherry-picked best seed：\n      (1) Seed123在repo-level的home server上已有partial results——cls4b-seed123-ckpt800\n      val5120准确率87.92%（validation），但test准确率仅75.33%（大幅val-test gap，\n      9784 samples），说明该seed严重过拟合；\n      (2) Seed456预计79.50%——居中但低于seed42，因为不同random initialization\n      在repo-level的高维parameter space中找到不同local minima；\n      (3) Multi-seed mean 79.88%落入worst档[75,80]范围，std 2.32pp表示\n      moderate但不negligible的variance；\n      (4) Seed42比mean高2.47pp，reviewer会质疑是否report了best seed；\n      (5) Fail_f1 mean仅57.16%（std 3.87pp），说明模型对failing tests的识别\n      在不同seed间极不稳定——这是diagnostic value的致命缺陷；\n      (6) CWM repo-level实验全部failed（unparseable 53-93%），无法计算cls-cwm gap，\n      reviewer会归因于experimental design而非formulation差异。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Repo-level CLS multi-seed results (Qwen3-4B)\"\n        columns: [\"Seed\", \"Accuracy %\", \"Fail F1 %\", \"Pass F1 %\", \"Unparseable %\"]\n        rows:\n          - [42, 82.35, 60.87, 89.59, 0.0]\n          - [123, 77.80, 53.20, 85.10, 1.5]\n          - [456, 79.50, 57.40, 87.30, 0.8]\n          - [\"Mean±Std\", \"79.88±2.32\", \"57.16±3.87\", \"87.33±2.25\", \"0.77±0.75\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Box plot: repo-level accuracy across seeds, showing wide spread and seed42 as outlier\"\n      - \"Scatter: seed-level accuracy vs fail_f1, showing positive correlation but high variance\"\n    analysis: >\n      Multi-seed mean 79.88%低于majority baseline+10pp threshold that reviewers\n      typically expect for \"meaningful\" improvement。Seed42的82.35%看起来decent\n      但它是3个seed中最好的——如果论文只报告seed42，reviewer会质疑cherry-picking。\n      报告3-seed mean则只有79.88%，不足以支撑strong repo-level claim。\n      Fail_f1的高variance（std 3.87pp）意味着per-test diagnostic在不同\n      random runs间不稳定——这与function-level（fail_f1 std ~0.92pp）形成鲜明对比。\n      在worst档pivot中，repo-level results降级为\"preliminary\"，\n      承认需要更多compute和hyperparameter tuning。\n\n  - name: \"Repo-Level CWM Revisited (Reviewer Challenge)\"\n    plan_id: \"repo-level-training\"\n    description: >\n      预测reviewer对repo-level CWM失败的质疑及重做实验的结果。\n      Reviewer会认为CWM failure是max_new_tokens/prompt设计导致，\n      要求增大token budget重做。\n    expected_results:\n      cwm_v10_accuracy: 69.91\n      cwm_v10_unparseable_pct: 93.0\n      cwm_v10_with_tok512_accuracy: 72.50\n      cwm_v10_with_tok512_unparseable_pct: 45.0\n      cwm_v10_with_tok1024_accuracy: 74.80\n      cwm_v10_with_tok1024_unparseable_pct: 28.0\n      cwm_v10_with_tok2048_accuracy: 75.50\n      cwm_v10_with_tok2048_unparseable_pct: 18.0\n      cwm_tok2048_vs_cls_gap_pp: -4.38\n      cwm_tok2048_inference_cost_ratio: 35.0\n      reviewer_satisfied: false\n      rebuttal_risk: \"high\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Worst档假设：\"Reviewer将CWM repo-level failure归因于max_new_tokens/prompt设计，\n      要求重做实验\"。实际已有的cwm-v10结果：accuracy 69.91%但93%unparseable。\n      Reviewer的合理质疑：\n      (1) max_new_tokens=64（D047记录）导致93% unparseable——这是obvious \n      experimental error，不是formulation的inherent limitation；\n      (2) 增大token budget到512后unparseable降至~45%，accuracy升至72.50%——\n      说明CWM failure是token budget artifact而非fundamental；\n      (3) 进一步增至1024 (28% unparseable, 74.80%) 和2048 (18%, 75.50%)，\n      CWM持续改善，但改善速度递减（diminishing returns）；\n      (4) 即使tok=2048，CWM仍低于CLS mean(79.88%) 约4.38pp——但这个gap\n      可能是因为CWM还可以进一步优化（prompt format、更大token budget、\n      post-processing）；\n      (5) Reviewer会说：\"You set up CWM to fail by limiting tokens. \n      A fair comparison needs CWM with sufficient token budget.\"——\n      即使我们argue CWM的高token cost是formulation的inherent cost，\n      reviewer关心的是accuracy comparison是否fair，not cost。\n      \n      CWM-tok2048的35x inference cost是efficiency argument的支撑，\n      但worst档下reviewer可能不买账：\"efficiency without accuracy parity \n      is not a contribution\"。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Repo-level CWM accuracy vs token budget (Qwen3-4B)\"\n        columns: [\"max_new_tokens\", \"Accuracy %\", \"Unparseable %\", \"Δ vs CLS mean (pp)\", \"Inference Cost (×)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [64, 69.91, 93.0, \"-9.97\", \"1.5×\"]\n          - [512, 72.50, 45.0, \"-7.38\", \"8×\"]\n          - [1024, 74.80, 28.0, \"-5.08\", \"16×\"]\n          - [2048, 75.50, 18.0, \"-4.38\", \"35×\"]\n          - [\"CLS (1 token)\", 79.88, 0.0, \"—\", \"1×\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Line plot: CWM accuracy vs token budget, showing diminishing returns curve approaching but not reaching CLS\"\n      - \"Dual-axis: accuracy (left) and unparseable rate (right) vs token budget, showing tradeoff\"\n    analysis: >\n      Token budget sweep是worst档rebuttal的核心风险。即使CWM-tok2048的accuracy\n      仍低于CLS，4.38pp gap在reviewer眼中可能\"来自其他confounds而非formulation\"。\n      在pivot论文中，这变为efficiency-accuracy tradeoff analysis：\n      CLS用1-token达到CWM 2048-token的更高accuracy——这是genuine contribution\n      但需要careful framing避免being dismissed as \"unfair comparison\"。\n\n  - name: \"Error Complementarity Deep Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"matched-seed-8b-predictions\"\n    description: >\n      CLS和CWM在matched seeds上的error overlap分析。\n      已有4B seed42数据（oracle 90.63%），预测8B和multi-seed结果。\n    expected_results:\n      oracle_ensemble_4b_seed42: 90.63\n      oracle_ensemble_4b_5seed_mean: 90.25\n      oracle_ensemble_8b_seed42: 93.10\n      oracle_ensemble_8b_3seed_mean: 92.50\n      cls_only_correct_pct_4b: 3.12\n      cwm_only_correct_pct_4b: 2.80\n      both_wrong_pct_4b: 9.37\n      cls_only_correct_pct_8b: 4.50\n      cwm_only_correct_pct_8b: 2.10\n      both_wrong_pct_8b: 4.40\n      cls_fn_dominance_pct: 75.5\n      cwm_fp_dominance_pct: 83.1\n      kappa_predictions_4b: 0.88\n      kappa_correctness_4b: 0.73\n      kappa_predictions_8b: 0.82\n      kappa_correctness_8b: 0.65\n      practical_ensemble_accuracy_4b: 88.90\n      practical_ensemble_accuracy_8b: 91.20\n      ensemble_vs_oracle_gap_4b_pp: 1.73\n      ensemble_vs_oracle_gap_8b_pp: 1.90\n    result_rationale: >\n      Error complementarity是worst档pivot叙事的三大支柱之一。\n      4B seed42的已有数据：oracle 90.63%（both correct 84.71%, CLS-only 3.12%, \n      CWM-only 2.80%, both wrong 9.37%）。\n      \n      Worst档下的补充预测：\n      (1) 4B 5-seed mean oracle降至90.25%——某些seeds的CLS/CWM errors更相关\n      （overlap更大），削弱complementarity；\n      (2) 8B oracle升至93.10%，因为8B models各自更强（fewer errors）但complementarity\n      pattern保持——CLS-only(4.5%) > CWM-only(2.1%)说明CWM的8B improvement\n      更多来自修正CWM-specific errors；\n      (3) CLS FN dominance 75.5%和CWM FP dominance 83.1%在不同seeds间\n      保持稳定（±3pp），说明这是formulation-level的systematic pattern而非\n      random artifact——这是worst档pivot的strongest evidence；\n      (4) Practical ensemble（simple voting而非oracle）只达到88.90%/91.20%，\n      低于oracle 1.73pp/1.90pp，说明error complementarity存在但\n      simple aggregation无法fully exploit它；\n      (5) Kappa(correctness)在8B下降至0.65（vs 4B的0.73），说明8B models\n      的errors更diverse——更多potential for complementarity但也更难aggregate。\n      \n      Worst档叙事：error complementarity是最robust的finding，不受\n      cls-vs-cwm accuracy comparison结果的影响。即使CLS≈CWM in accuracy，\n      它们的failure modes仍systematically不同，这本身就是有价值的characterization。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Error overlap analysis (function-level, matched seeds)\"\n        columns: [\"Category\", \"4B seed42 (%)\", \"4B 5-seed mean (%)\", \"8B 3-seed mean (%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Both correct\", 84.71, 84.35, 89.00]\n          - [\"CLS-only correct\", 3.12, 2.95, 4.50]\n          - [\"CWM-only correct\", 2.80, 2.65, 2.10]\n          - [\"Both wrong\", 9.37, 10.05, 4.40]\n          - [\"Oracle ensemble\", 90.63, 90.25, 93.10]\n      - caption: \"Error type asymmetry (CLS vs CWM)\"\n        columns: [\"Error Type\", \"CLS (%)\", \"CWM (%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"False Negative (miss bug)\", 75.5, 16.9]\n          - [\"False Positive (false alarm)\", 24.5, 83.1]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Venn diagram: CLS errors vs CWM errors showing limited overlap\"\n      - \"Stacked bar: error type breakdown for CLS vs CWM showing complementary asymmetry\"\n      - \"Line plot: oracle ensemble accuracy across seeds, showing stability\"\n    analysis: >\n      Error complementarity在worst档下是最defensible的contribution。\n      它不依赖于CLS > CWM的claim——即使CLS ≈ CWM，它们fail on different \n      instances in predictable ways (CLS: conservative → miss bugs; \n      CWM: noisy generation → false alarms)。Oracle ensemble 90.63%\n      作为upper bound motivates future work on learned ensemble strategies。\n      在pivot论文中，这可以成为Section 5: \"Complementary Failure Modes \n      as a Verification Strategy\"的核心内容。\n\n  - name: \"Efficiency Equivalence Analysis\"\n    plan_id: \"inference-cost-comparison\"\n    description: >\n      CLS (1-token) vs CWM (N-token) 的inference cost对比。\n      已有CPU数据（3.1x token overhead, 1.09x latency），\n      预测GPU场景和repo-level scaling。\n    expected_results:\n      func_level_cpu:\n        cls_output_tokens_mean: 2.0\n        cwm_output_tokens_mean: 6.2\n        token_ratio: 3.1\n        latency_ratio: 1.09\n        throughput_ratio: 0.92\n      func_level_gpu:\n        cls_latency_ms: 45\n        cwm_latency_ms: 85\n        latency_ratio: 1.89\n        cls_throughput_sps: 22.2\n        cwm_throughput_sps: 11.8\n        throughput_ratio: 1.88\n      repo_level_gpu:\n        cls_output_tokens: 2\n        cwm_output_tokens_mean: 45\n        cwm_output_tokens_p95: 180\n        token_ratio: 22.5\n        cls_latency_ms: 320\n        cwm_latency_ms: 2800\n        latency_ratio: 8.75\n        cls_throughput_sps: 3.1\n        cwm_throughput_sps: 0.36\n        throughput_ratio: 8.6\n      batch_inference_1000_instances:\n        cls_total_time_min: 5.4\n        cwm_total_time_min: 46.3\n        speedup: 8.6\n      cost_per_1000_instances_a100:\n        cls_cost_usd: 0.05\n        cwm_cost_usd: 0.43\n        cost_ratio: 8.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Efficiency equivalence是worst档pivot的angle之一：\"CLS用1-token output\n      达到CWM N-token相同accuracy，inference cost降低\"。\n      \n      已有CPU数据显示仅1.09x latency差异，因为prefill dominates——但这\n      低估了real-world GPU差异：\n      (1) Function-level GPU：prefill仍dominates但per-token decode在GPU上\n      更parallel-efficient，CWM的6.2 mean output tokens导致1.89x latency——\n      比CPU的1.09x更明显但仍不dramatic，因为function-level outputs很短；\n      (2) Repo-level GPU：CWM output tokens mean=45 (p95=180)，latency ratio\n      升至8.75x——这是efficiency argument的sweet spot；\n      (3) 但worst档下accuracy comparison存疑（CLS 79.88% vs CWM ~75.50%@tok2048），\n      reviewer会说\"efficiency comparison only meaningful at accuracy parity\"；\n      (4) Batch inference场景：1000 instances处理时间CLS 5.4min vs CWM 46.3min，\n      8.6x speedup——在best-of-N verification pipeline中（K=16 candidates × \n      T=15 tests = 240 predictions per instance），CLS的low latency is genuinely \n      valuable for interactive repair workflows。\n      \n      Worst档影响：efficiency argument在function-level很弱（1.09-1.89x），\n      只在repo-level显著（8.75x）。但repo-level accuracy不足使得efficiency\n      claim变为\"faster at a task it doesn't do well at\"——需要careful framing。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Inference cost comparison: CLS vs CWM\"\n        columns: [\"Setting\", \"CLS Latency\", \"CWM Latency\", \"Speedup\", \"Accuracy Gap\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Func-level CPU\", \"9.76s\", \"10.61s\", \"1.09×\", \"~0pp\"]\n          - [\"Func-level GPU\", \"45ms\", \"85ms\", \"1.89×\", \"~1.25pp\"]\n          - [\"Repo-level GPU\", \"320ms\", \"2.8s\", \"8.75×\", \"~4.38pp\"]\n      - caption: \"Cost projection: 1000-instance verification (A100)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Time (min)\", \"Cost (USD)\", \"Accuracy (%)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"CLS (repo)\", 5.4, \"$0.05\", 79.88]\n          - [\"CWM tok-2048 (repo)\", 46.3, \"$0.43\", 75.50]\n          - [\"CWM tok-512 (repo)\", 12.1, \"$0.11\", 72.50]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto frontier: accuracy vs inference cost for CLS, CWM at various token budgets, and LLM-judge baselines\"\n      - \"Bar chart: speedup ratio across complexity levels (func vs repo)\"\n    analysis: >\n      Efficiency是worst档中唯一的\"clear win\" for CLS——但只在repo-level显著。\n      Pareto frontier图将是论文的key figure之一：CLS dominates at every cost level。\n      但reviewer可能要求CWM with unlimited tokens作为accuracy upper bound，\n      如果CWM with sufficient tokens matches CLS accuracy，efficiency argument\n      reduces to \"same accuracy, lower cost\"——这是less exciting但still valid contribution。\n```\n\n总结：worst档下的核心转变是从\"CLS > CWM\"到\"CLS ≈ CWM with complementary failure modes\"。8个imagined experiments覆盖了：\n- 2个planned实验（diagnostic-rerepair、swebench-pertest-data）\n- 4个running DeepSeek实验\n- 2个implied实验（repo-level multi-seed、efficiency analysis）\n\n最致命的findings：(1) DeepSeek CLS-CWM gap仅0.52pp，削弱architecture-independence；(2) repo-level multi-seed mean ~80%，seed variance ~2.3pp；(3) re-repair gain仅+0.5pp，not significant。最robust的贡献：error complementarity（oracle 90.63%）和efficiency Pareto dominance。","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"23fb2834-2812-4457-b569-54861da1d013","total_cost_usd":1.29138415,"usage":{"input_tokens":1943,"cache_creation_input_tokens":55957,"cache_read_input_tokens":159181,"output_tokens":18056,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":55957,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1939,"output_tokens":14116,"cache_read_input_tokens":62088,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5570,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5570},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":25336,"outputTokens":10927,"cacheReadInputTokens":1160164,"cacheCreationInputTokens":163968,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.40094740000000006,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":1943,"outputTokens":18056,"cacheReadInputTokens":159181,"cacheCreationInputTokens":55957,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.8904367500000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"fa319ba1-c958-4833-9b74-89e10bf57e0b"}
